# Contact form delivery (WEB-NAV-001 A5, option 2). Set in Vercel only — never commit a value.
# HTTPS endpoint that receives one JSON enquiry per POST and forwards it to the business inbox.
# The site shows "Your enquiry has been received" only when this endpoint acknowledges
# acceptance: HTTP 202, or a 2xx response whose JSON body contains "accepted": true
# (also accepted: "ok": true or "success": true). Any other 2xx is reported as unconfirmed.
# When unset, /contact renders without the form.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
